{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/972360-sphere-magic-and-arcane","id":972360,"title":"Sphere magic and Arcane.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-18T22:54:01-07:00","id":972360,"title":"Sphere magic and Arcane.","content":"Arcane obscures a mage and their activities from the observation of Sleepers and Awakened alike. But what about their magic? It seems possible that directly altering reality might not fall under the occultation of the Aracane Background. Magic unavoidably involves a mage in the Tapestry. How could it do so without leaving a mark? Especially Vulgar magic. It seems the discovery of a mage's Vulgar manipulations might even prompt people to remember things they had forgotten about the mage, and make connections they didn't make before--to remove their veil of Arcane completely, at least for a time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T23:23:36-07:00","id":972365,"title":"","content":"According to M20, Arcane works only for as long as you don't attract attention.<br /> <br /> You get bonus dice for Stealth and they get penalty for their Perception, and it might mess around with their memories about you and how you looked like, but it won't protect you if you just attracted attention to yourself no matter how.<br /> <br /> You do something loud and universe does a slow clap. You do vulgar magick next to Sleepers, and universe does a veeeery slow clap.<br /> <br /> In a nutshell: doesn't matter if it's mundane action or magick. If it's possible to notice your doing and it attracts attention, well, thou art fucked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12132-bogdan","name":"Bogdan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T01:06:08-07:00","id":972389,"title":"","content":"At the very least, a Paradox Backlash isn't going to be deterred by Arcane since you've quite blatantly reminded the universe you exist, and it might well strike the Mage in such a way that it makes them obvious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6072-quantumboost","name":"Quantumboost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6072_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"590"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T04:00:33-07:00","id":972444,"title":"","content":"I'd say that Arcane makes it easier to slip away when escaping, makes your features harder to recall, and makes it more difficult for people to recognise you.<br /> <br /> They can still see you if your just standing there doing stuff, they'll just be less likely to identify you.<br /> <br /> Of course, the more familiar you are with the mage in question, the less likely Arcane will have an effect on you.<br /> <br /> Mind effects to disappear or blend in to the crowd and Entropy effects to decrease the chance that people would spot you or wonder near you can give you something more analogous to what you were describing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T07:39:33-07:00","id":972517,"title":"","content":"Even in Revised it says that you can't completely hide behind Arcane if you're just not being sneaky. The example given being someone with pink hair. They'll forget everything else, but they'll REMEMBER that pink hair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T15:46:11-07:00","id":972785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/972360-sphere-magic-and-arcane?p=972517#post972517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even in Revised it says that you can't completely hide behind Arcane if you're just not being sneaky. The example given being someone with pink hair. They'll forget everything else, but they'll REMEMBER that pink hair.</div> </div> </div> </div>However, they may not remember the exact shade of pink, or what style the hair was cut in. In both Revised and M20, the Background description implies that, even when leaving an impression is unavoidable, Arcane still makes that impression...&quot;fuzzy&quot; around the edges. You might have been missing an arm, but damned if witnesses remember which one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T00:07:38-07:00","id":972975,"title":"","content":"I used Arcane as Paradox Flaw.<br /> I just highlighted the logical negative sides:<br /> Your company forgets to pay you.<br /> Your bank account ceases to exist.<br /> You have difficulty to prove to the officer that it is indeed your house...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T00:37:06-07:00","id":972982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/972360-sphere-magic-and-arcane?p=972975#post972975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I used Arcane as Paradox Flaw.<br /> I just highlighted the logical negative sides:<br /> Your company forgets to pay you.<br /> Your bank account ceases to exist.<br /> You have difficulty to prove to the officer that it is indeed your house...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what Resplendent Destinies are for!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6072-quantumboost","name":"Quantumboost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6072_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"590"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T02:01:59-07:00","id":973002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/972360-sphere-magic-and-arcane?p=972975#post972975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I used Arcane as Paradox Flaw.<br /> I just highlighted the logical negative sides:<br /> Your company forgets to pay you.<br /> Your bank account ceases to exist.<br /> You have difficulty to prove to the officer that it is indeed your house...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's how I RPed one of my Verbena characters who, during her pre-RP backstory, couldn't control it at first and It went so far as that her parents forgot she existed, her landlord didn't remember her, her bank account was gone and...yeah. (Arcane 6 by the Ahl-i_batin book, but I just had Arcane 5 do that to her).<br /> She ended up as a Lifeweaver living in the wild, and occasionally hung out in the city 'disguised' as a bum. It made for a tragic backstory, really, with her sitting outside her parent's place on each of her birthdays, watching her family go on without remembering her.<br /> <br /> Arcane is powerful, but it should always be a double-edged sword. The more heavy the effects the ST allows for, the harder normal life should get, IMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T07:30:26-07:00","id":973128,"title":"","content":"If a player buys Arcane I highlight the positive side more, but if I hand out a couple of dots then it comes with downsides...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T23:54:01-07:00","id":973696,"title":"","content":"re: downsides, can't mages switch it off when they want? I don't think it's supposed to be a burden like it is for the Sidereal Exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T01:56:45-07:00","id":973725,"title":"","content":"Yes, but as a flaw the switch has a malfunction \ud83d\udc7f<br /> <br /> And as background you can dampen the effect for a scene and afterwards it kicks back in. I imagine it in a manner of staving of sleep, you can manage it for a time but it gets uncomfortable fast.<br /> <br /> Once you hit a rating above 5 the dampening ceases functioning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}